# Set only after Vercel assigns the actual permanent production URL.
# Include https://. Use the same permanent origin in Vercel Production and Preview scopes.
# Rebuild after changes. Do not use a deployment-specific preview URL.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
# VERCEL_ENV is supplied by Vercel. Only production + a configured origin is indexable.
# Preview and development builds remain noindex, even when the origin is configured.
